      en: ["The museum was founded in 1966 by benefactor Eric Harvie.", "It houses over 1.3 million artifacts and works of art.", "It is the largest museum by area in Western Canada.", "The archives contain over five kilometers of textual records.", "A multi-year renovation project of the main building began in 2022.", "The museum features one of the best Blackfoot culture collections in the world."],
